---
import Section from '../ui/Section.astro';
import { Clock, Users, FileX } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<Section id="problem" className="relative">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
    <div
      class="bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground border-border/50 mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-sm backdrop-blur-sm"
    >
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
      La realidad del sector
    </div>

    <h2
      class="text-foreground mb-16 font-serif text-4xl leading-tight font-medium tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl"
    >
      "La hostelería no es difícil por la comida. <br class="hidden md:block" /> Es difícil por la <span
        class="from-foreground to-muted-foreground bg-linear-to-br bg-clip-text text-transparent italic"
        >gestión caótica</span
      >."
    </h2>

    <div class="grid gap-8 text-left md:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Pain Point 1 -->
      <div
        class="group bg-card/30 border-border/50 hover:bg-card hover:shadow-tomato/5 hover:border-tomato/20 rounded-2xl border p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg"
      >
        <div
          class="bg-tomato/10 text-tomato ring-tomato/20 group-hover:bg-tomato/20 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl ring-1 transition-colors"
        >
          <Clock class="h-7 w-7" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-medium">Tiempos muertos</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Camareros corriendo entre la sala y el TPV. Cocina descifrando tickets en papel.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pain Point 2 -->
      <div
        class="group bg-card/30 border-border/50 hover:bg-card hover:shadow-blueberry/5 hover:border-blueberry/20 rounded-2xl border p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg"
      >
        <div
          class="bg-blueberry/10 text-blueberry ring-blueberry/20 group-hover:bg-blueberry/20 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl ring-1 transition-colors"
        >
          <Users class="h-7 w-7" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-medium">Errores de personal</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">
          "¿Quién pidió esto?" Platos fríos esperando ser servidos. Propinas perdidas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pain Point 3 -->
      <div
        class="group bg-card/30 border-border/50 hover:bg-card hover:shadow-espresso/5 hover:border-espresso/20 rounded-2xl border p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg"
      >
        <div
          class="bg-espresso/10 text-espresso ring-espresso/20 group-hover:bg-espresso/20 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl ring-1 transition-colors"
        >
          <FileX class="h-7 w-7" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-medium">Descontrol total</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Cierre de caja con descuadres. Sin datos reales de qué se vende y qué no.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
